              "value": "Portal Redirection"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(conjuration, divine, teleportation)\n\nTrigger: Syndara is targeted by a ranged Strike or spell attack roll\n\nSyndara opens a portal in front of the incoming missile, then opens another portal nearby that fires the missile at another creature within 60 feet of him. He takes no damage from the triggering attack and makes a ranged Strike with a +43 bonus. The Strike deals damage according to the triggering ability."
